"P3239997922" "<t=2> <t=4 d=4>Some Midnighters in back. Names Montague, Sigil, Kadabra Kill, Sheldon. Heard rumor another is helping them."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3717497309" "Destroyed Armor"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3793214176" "I'm dead!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1336453161" "KO Midnighter"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P473071889" "Montague Castanella"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYINFO :
"P2250345822" "Beyond his interest in all matters arcane, Montague Castanella has a unique ability. He is unaffected by temporal shifts. Somehow, his brain can perceive alterations within a timeline. He did not realize he had this ability until Ouroboros arrived and began adjusting the timeline to better prepare for a future attack. <br><br>However, this has also awakened him to other adjustments being made by groups other than Ouroboros. <br><br>He has taken the lead in recruiting heroes to join the Midnight Squad, believing that now, more than ever, their knowledge and expertise are needed to combat the Rikti as well as other threats. "
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1651558265" "<t=10 d=5>Tommy, enough! You're speaking to a villain and a -thief-.<t=5 d=5>Do not worry yourself. {HeroName}, I am not in the mood to be polite. We have suffered much already here.<t=5 d=5>We will not tolerate ANY further thieving, from you, OR the Rulu-Shin!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1213184603" "Kadabra Kill"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P648659700" "Sigil"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1431431864" "Mercedes Sheldon"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3499251020" "Living Armor"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P24148231" "You were too late to steal much from the Midnighters, but you might have a lead as to where the Rulu-Shin are keeping their items."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4222080918" "Hrm, it seems Rulu-Shin are faster than I would have thought. That is fine, however. We have plenty to work with to find them.<br><br>I think you and I may have stumbled into what they call 'jackpot'. You spoke to man named Tommy Arcanus, correct? He is father of heroine called <color yellow>Numina</color>. It would appear Rulu-Shin have kidnapped him, along with several artifacts.<br><br>I do not know what they want with father of Numina, but I believe we can make this work to our advantage, yes? We track down Rulu-Shin, steal artifacts back, then ransom skull to heroes! I do not care for much in the way of pay, myself; I merely wish to see Rulu-Shin plot stopped. All money will go to you, all personal satisfaction to <i>me</i>.  Feel free to be satisfied yourself, however. Just know that I will do what it takes to help you fight Rulu-Shin and get one up over heroes of Paragon."

