// Page Intro Text :
"P3939226009" "You stannnnd before an innnnner sannnnnctummmmmm. Annnnnswer the questionnnnnns to prove your worth.<br><br>The floatinnnng <color yellow>watchers</color>, the lithe <color yellow>wisps</color>, the powerful <color yellow>brutes</color>.<br><br>All immmmportant, all part of the cause. Onnnnne is mmmmore immmmportant thannnn the other. Who is it?"
// Page Intro SayOutLoudText :
"P3335837987" "You stannnnd before an innnnner sannnnnctummmmmm. Annnnnswer the questionnnnnns to prove your worth."
// Answer Text :
"P2501844814" "The floating watcher"
// Answer Text :
"P804227059" "The powerful brute"
// Answer Text :
"P1791211803" "The lithe wisp"
// Page Page2 Text :
"P3500851942" "Hortha Vines. Kora Fruit. Echoes. All immmportant to Rularuu. Onnnne serves mmmmore, onnne attracts mmmore. Which onnnne attracts more?"
// Answer Text :
"P3938504737" "Echoes."
// Answer Text :
"P657464356" "Hortha Vines"
// Answer Text :
"P2285123453" "Kora Fruit"
// Page Page3 Text :
"P202981375" "The Stormmmm palace. Channnntry. Archipelago. Two belonnnng to Rularuu. Onnnne is hommmmmme to a monnnnster, separate from Rularuu. Where does the monnnnster live?"
// Answer Text :
"P3005842277" "Storm Palace"
// Answer Text :
"P677012602" "Chantry"
// Answer Text :
"P3531939855" "Archipelago"
// Page Finished Text :
"P1190811697" "You have provennn yourself. You may pass."
// Answer Text :
