// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - GuardTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3640483696" "{HeroName}. Heard of you. What do you want?"
// Answer Text :
"P33131715" "I'm here to make a deal with your boss. Let me through."
// Page Pass Text :
"P2037095503" "Alright, but you try anything funny and you're <i>dead</i>, got it?"
// Page Pass SayOutLoudText :
"P3187191622" "Alright, but you try anything funny and you're dead, got it?"
// Answer Text :
"P791399225" "Sure."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Manager 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Ambushed Text :
"P362322018" "You won't get out of here alive, {HeroName}!"
// Page OKtoTalk Text :
"P1353114719" "Ah... {HeroName}, right? Well, great to see you. Just... <i>great</i> to see you.<br><br>Harry Stein, at your service. What can I do for you?"
// Page OKtoTalk SayOutLoudText :
"P1540937441" "Ah... {HeroName}, right? Well, great to see you. Just... great to see you.<br><br>Harry Stein, at your service. What can I do for you?"
// Answer Text :
"P2845967385" "I'm here for the stolen artifacts the Rulu-Shin have. Let's make this quick and simple."
// Page NotOK Text :
"P3172990345" "GUARDS!"
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"
// Page Interrogate Text :
"P2537890566" "Rulu-Shin? Artifacts?<br><br><color orange>Harry Stein lets out a laugh, running a hand along his sweaty cheeks.</color><br><br>I wish I knew what you were talking about! The Rulu-Shin are just a fairy tale, and all of my artifacts here were obtained through legal means.<br><br>Now, unless you'd like to be hired on for a little expedition I'm planning, I must ask you to leave."
// Page Interrogate SayOutLoudText :
"P343487137" "Rulu-Shin? Artifacts? I wish I knew what you were talking about! The Rulu-Shin are just a fairy tale, and all of my artifacts here were obtained through legal means"
// Answer Text :
"P2090168180" "I don't need you anyway, Stein. (Kill Harry Stein)"
// Answer Text :
"P1662621816" "I'm not done here yet, Stein. (Leave)"
// Page BadCop Text :
"P3073421884" "<color orange>You kill Harry Stein, setting off the alarms in the building!</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Numina 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1871400670" "Alright, {HeroName}. You have my father. Now hand him over, <i>now</i>, or else this is going to get ugly very fast."
// Page Intro SayOutLoudText :
"P975168308" "Alright, {HeroName}. You have my father. Now hand him over, now, or else this is going to get ugly very fast."
// Answer Text :
"P2766504763" "Alright, here you go."
// Answer Text :
"P1060753605" "Don't make a move, or else your father's skull will end up in tiny little pieces."
// Page Nothing Text :
"P4125613633" "<color orange>You hand the skull over to Numina, who looks somewhat surprised.</color><br><br>... What? Just like that?<br><br>I'm... Somewhat confused, {HeroName}, but I'm not going to stick around to ask why you did this. Perhaps there is a noble soul in you somewhere.<br><br>Farewell, for now. I think..."
// Page Nothing SayOutLoudText :
"P1464580603" "I'm... Somewhat confused, {HeroName}, but I'm not going to stick around to ask why you did this. Perhaps there is a noble soul in you somewhere. Farewell, for now. I think..."
// Answer Text :
"P358642488" "See you around."
// Page Threaten Text :
"P3257001598" "<color orange>Numina glares at you, but she seems to understand the current situation.</color><br><br>Alright, {HeroName}. I know how this goes.<br><br>You want to bargain my father, don't you? Fine. I have an artifact that you can use.<br><br>It will fully heal you and anyone else who can stand to be around you - perfect for when you're getting hurt kicking puppies in the street.<br><br>I'll give you that in exchange for my father. Deal?"
// Page Threaten SayOutLoudText :
"P3572811838" "Fine. I have an artifact that you can use. It will fully heal you and anyone else who can stand to be around you - perfect for when you're getting hurt kicking puppies in the street. I'll give you that in exchange for my father. Deal?"
// Answer Text :
"P3744787981" "I knew we could come to a happy conclusion. Deal."
// Page Artifact Text :
"P3913027274" "<color orange>You and Numina make the exchange. Without another word, Numina vanishes in thin air with her father, who shouts a string of profanities at you before he vanishes.</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1112712926" "It is my belief that Rulu-Shin may be feeding artifacts and people they retrieved to some monster. If that is case, then we are in double trouble, as they say. We would go through all trouble without big pay off at end, especially if Tommy Arcanus is part of the feeding.<br><br>Feeding this monster must make it more powerful, enough to help in grand goal of summoning Rularuu. But we can worry about that later, for now, there is much to talk about regarding Harry Stein."
// AcceptString :
"P3236331552" "Such as?"
// SendOffString :
"P1225433698" "He has numerous security guards in his store. Not that it is something to bother you with, but it is something to note. I will circle outside and take care of any incoming guards, but you will have to deal with guards on inside, once alarm is tripped.<br><br>He currently is hosting viewing of number of artifacts that he has acquired. Most people there live in Rogue Isles all of their lives and have dealt with super powered beings before. They will not flinch when they see you, yes?<br><br>What needs to happen is that you gain access to the vault to get artifacts. There is no way to do this without setting off alarms. I would suggest going straight to vault, but if you want to pay Harry Stein small visit and say 'thank you' for all trouble he caused, I would not be against it.<br><br>The biggest thing is to find artifacts and track down remaining Rulu-Shin in store. I do not think they would keep all artifacts in vault, but because of that, you should be careful. <color orange>Rulu-Shin may be using powerful artifacts, you should bring what they call 'A-Game' when going up against them.</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1610192539" "Attack the Rulu-Shin Hideout"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1164173415" "I will be making sure that Harry Stein does not see you coming in meantime, {HeroName}."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3344760109" "<color deepskyblue>Finale: Strike a Deal</color>"

