"P2780540198" "Strike a deal with Numina for her father"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3588928641" "<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>A sentry of Rularuu! That must be what they were feeding. <t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>All is not lost. I've hacked security systems, see that high ranking member is fleeing with Tommy Arcanus. <t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>Suggest you hurry to catch him, he is jumping through weird portals, seems to be desperate to escape your reach."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2784602077" "<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor MediumOrchid>Not so fast! Rularuu has gifted us with his Natterling swarm, they will destroy you!"

