// 0 Actor1 :
"P1893117558" "<em sitstool>"
// 5 Caption :
"P3663186523" "<x=0.5 y=0.2 t=6 d=5><scale 1.75><color Silver><bgcolor DimGray>Meanwhile, in the back of a bar in the Rogue Isles..."
// 6 Actor1 :
"P1389899889" "<t=6 d=6>The skull of Tommy Arcanus has been recovered by Numina. However, I have the information found by the Rulu-Shin."
// 6 Actor1 :
"P3525266708" "<t=6 d=6>Numina's ability to possess someone else comes from the Arcanus family line, not from a specific spell she learned."
// 6 Actor2 :
"P51312671" "<t=6 d=6>Hrm... unfortunate. We could destroy her, but the obelisk will not absorb the powers of a spectre."
// 5 Actor1 :
"P1523954763" "<t=5 d=5> Does this mean that the list is shortened? That we can go after the one you first spoke of?"
// 5 Actor2 :
"P848074931" "<t=5 d=5> Calm yourself. This is no simple plan, there are... steps that must be taken. But yes, we are moving towards that; hence the recovery of the power intensifier."
// 5 Actor2 :
"P4141865761" "<t=5 d=5>We must make our next move, one that will put Manticore and Statesman in our way. You know what to do."
// 6 Actor1 :
"P350240704" "<t=6 d=6> ...Fine. I will send the message to Marshal Blitz and begin our trap. But you had better save the killing blow for me. "
// 5 Actor2 :
"P3395020872" "<t=5 d=5> Oh, I shall. I believe I will begin to focus on what to do with {HeroName} when the time is right."
