// Dialog :
"P1708260220" "You've done what you came here for. The Rulu-Shin's plan is stopped, and they won't be moving it any further."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2621421640" "Well, {HeroName}, it was pleasure working with you. I believe we have stopped Rulu-Shin who are in Isles, for now. I take great satisfaction knowing that; I hope you gave yourself proper payment out of whole thing.<br><br>Rulu-Shin are still growing threat within Americas, however. I believe there are numerous senators who may be involved in group. That is not something you need to worry about, however. I have secret I shall share with you, {HeroName}.<br><br>Spetsnaz, Russian government, we are aware of what Rulu-Shin are planning. They made wrong move in trying to rough me up, played right into trap. We do not intend on letting them get away with summoning Rularuu. Russia will be ones to do what Americans cannot: save world. When that is done, we shall be seen as heroes, saving country of freedom from its own problems. World will change when that day comes, {HeroName}.<br><br>You can trust that Mother Russia will not forget working together with you; this is first step amongst many."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
